</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/ffd2487510aa438433a2579450ab2b3d557e5edc" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:1.23ex; height:1.676ex;" alt="{\displaystyle a}"/></span>, that is <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt26" id="mwPg" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\\forall b \\in A"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle \forall b\in A}">
