</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/cff2238aaeffa659cd619408c618a69eef12c122" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.838ex; width:17.625ex; height:2.843ex;" alt="{\displaystyle (b,a)\in R,\exists c\in E}"/></span> such that <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt28" id="mwQA" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"(c,b) \\in R"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle (c,b)\in R}">
