</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/14821a7f22334b0b8266ef73499efdd5de0248ea" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.838ex; width:9.452ex; height:2.843ex;" alt="{\displaystyle (c,b)\in R}"/></span>,</li>
<li id="mwQQ">a set of arguments <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt29" id="mwQg" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"E"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle E}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>E</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle E}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/4232c9de2ee3eec0a9c0a19b15ab92daa6223f9b" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:1.776ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle E}"/></span> is conflict-free if there is no attack between its arguments, formally<span typeof="mw:DisplaySpace" id="mwQw"> </span>: <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt30" id="mwRA" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\\forall a, b \\in E, (a,b) \\not\\in R"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle \forall a,b\in E,(a,b)\not \in R}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi mathvariant="normal">∀<!-- ∀ --></mi>
        <mi>a</mi>
        <mo>,</mo>
        <mi>b</mi>
        <mo>∈<!-- ∈ --></mo>
        <mi>E</mi>
        <mo>,</mo>
        <mo stretchy="false">(</mo>
        <mi>a</mi>
        <mo>,</mo>
        <mi>b</mi>
        <mo stretchy="false">)</mo>
        <mo>∉</mo>
        <mi>R</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle \forall a,b\in E,(a,b)\not \in R}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/442412243998f38350e331f9e48602dc56120ab3" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.838ex; width:19.879ex; height:2.843ex;" alt="{\displaystyle \forall a,b\in E,(a,b)\not \in R}"/></span>,</li>
<li id="mwRQ">a set of arguments <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt31" id="mwRg" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"E"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle E}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>E</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle E}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/4232c9de2ee3eec0a9c0a19b15ab92daa6223f9b" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:1.776ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle E}"/></span> is admissible if and only if it is conflict-free and all its arguments are acceptable with respect to <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt32" id="mwRw" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"E"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle E}">
  <semantics>
