      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle E}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/4232c9de2ee3eec0a9c0a19b15ab92daa6223f9b" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:1.776ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle E}"/></span>.</li></ul>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="3" id="mwSA" aria-labelledby="Different_semantics_of_acceptance"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Different_semantics_of_acceptance">Different semantics of acceptance</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Argumentation_framework&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3" title="Edit section: Different semantics of acceptance"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>

<section data-mw-section-id="4" id="mwSQ" aria-labelledby="Extensions"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading4"><h4 id="Extensions">Extensions</h4><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Argumentation_framework&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4" title="Edit section: Extensions"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwSg">To decide if an argument can be accepted or not, or if several arguments can be accepted together, Dung defines several semantics of acceptance that allows, given an argumentation system, sets of arguments (called <i id="mwSw">extensions</i>) to be computed. For instance, given <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt33" id="mwTA" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"S = \\langle A, R\\rangle"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle S=\langle A,R\rangle }">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>S</mi>
        <mo>=</mo>
        <mo fence="false" stretchy="false">⟨<!-- ⟨ --></mo>
        <mi>A</mi>
        <mo>,</mo>
        <mi>R</mi>
        <mo fence="false" stretchy="false">⟩<!-- ⟩ --></mo>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle S=\langle A,R\rangle }</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/84dbf0469d812357aabc78d46bab6afd8962a83f" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.838ex; width:10.948ex; height:2.843ex;" alt="{\displaystyle S=\langle A,R\rangle }"/></span>,</p>
<ul id="mwTQ"><li id="mwTg"><span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt34" id="mwTw" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"E"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle E}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>E</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle E}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/4232c9de2ee3eec0a9c0a19b15ab92daa6223f9b" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:1.776ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle E}"/></span> is a complete extension of <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt35" id="mwUA" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"S"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle S}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>S</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle S}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/4611d85173cd3b508e67077d4a1252c9c05abca2" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:1.499ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle S}"/></span> only if it is an <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Admissible_set" title="Admissible set" id="mwUQ">admissible set</a> and every acceptable argument with respect to <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt36" id="mwUg" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"E"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle E}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>E</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle E}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/4232c9de2ee3eec0a9c0a19b15ab92daa6223f9b" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:1.776ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle E}"/></span> belongs to <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt37" id="mwUw" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"E"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle E}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>E</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle E}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/4232c9de2ee3eec0a9c0a19b15ab92daa6223f9b" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:1.776ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle E}"/></span>,</li>
<li id="mwVA"><span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt38" id="mwVQ" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"E"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle E}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>E</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle E}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/4232c9de2ee3eec0a9c0a19b15ab92daa6223f9b" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:1.776ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle E}"/></span> is a preferred extension of <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt39" id="mwVg" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"S"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle S}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>S</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle S}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/4611d85173cd3b508e67077d4a1252c9c05abca2" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:1.499ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle S}"/></span> only if it is a maximal element (with respect to the set-theoretical inclusion) among the admissible sets with respect to <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt40" id="mwVw" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"S"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle S}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>S</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle S}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/4611d85173cd3b508e67077d4a1252c9c05abca2" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:1.499ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle S}"/></span>,</li>
<li id="mwWA"><span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt41" id="mwWQ" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"E"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle E}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>E</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle E}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/4232c9de2ee3eec0a9c0a19b15ab92daa6223f9b" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:1.776ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle E}"/></span> is a stable extension of <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt42" id="mwWg" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"S"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle S}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>S</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle S}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/4611d85173cd3b508e67077d4a1252c9c05abca2" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:1.499ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle S}"/></span> only if it is a conflict-free set that attacks every argument that does not belong in <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt43" id="mwWw" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"E"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle E}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>E</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle E}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/4232c9de2ee3eec0a9c0a19b15ab92daa6223f9b" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:1.776ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle E}"/></span> (formally, <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt44" id="mwXA" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\\forall a \\in A \\backslash E, \\exists b \\in E"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle \forall a\in A\backslash E,\exists b\in E}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi mathvariant="normal">∀<!-- ∀ --></mi>
        <mi>a</mi>
        <mo>∈<!-- ∈ --></mo>
        <mi>A</mi>
        <mi class="MJX-variant" mathvariant="normal">∖<!-- ∖ --></mi>
        <mi>E</mi>
        <mo>,</mo>
        <mi mathvariant="normal">∃<!-- ∃ --></mi>
        <mi>b</mi>
        <mo>∈<!-- ∈ --></mo>
        <mi>E</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle \forall a\in A\backslash E,\exists b\in E}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/459cd04fcbc151b244fd32a5de22a303e6eccc24" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.838ex; width:17.984ex; height:2.843ex;" alt="{\displaystyle \forall a\in A\backslash E,\exists b\in E}"/></span> such that <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt45" id="mwXQ" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"(b,a) \\in R"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle (b,a)\in R}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mo stretchy="false">(</mo>
        <mi>b</mi>
        <mo>,</mo>
        <mi>a</mi>
        <mo stretchy="false">)</mo>
        <mo>∈<!-- ∈ --></mo>
        <mi>R</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle (b,a)\in R}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/0c5def52499c1a564d63029513c2150f73b11656" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.838ex; width:9.675ex; height:2.843ex;" alt="{\displaystyle (b,a)\in R}"/></span>,</li>
<li id="mwXg"><span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt46" id="mwXw" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"E"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle E}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>E</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle E}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/4232c9de2ee3eec0a9c0a19b15ab92daa6223f9b" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:1.776ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle E}"/></span> is the (unique) grounded extension of <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt47" id="mwYA" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"S"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle S}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>S</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle S}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/4611d85173cd3b508e67077d4a1252c9c05abca2" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:1.499ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle S}"/></span> only if it is the smallest element (with respect to set inclusion) among the complete extensions of <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt48" id="mwYQ" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"S"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle S}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>S</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle S}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/4611d85173cd3b508e67077d4a1252c9c05abca2" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:1.499ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle S}"/></span>.</li></ul>
<p id="mwYg">There exists some inclusions between the sets of extensions built with these semantics<span typeof="mw:DisplaySpace" id="mwYw"> </span>:</p>
<ul id="mwZA"><li id="mwZQ">Every stable extension is preferred,</li>
<li id="mwZg">Every preferred extension is complete,</li>
<li id="mwZw">The grounded extension is complete,</li>
<li id="mwaA">If the system is well-founded (there exists no infinite sequence <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt49" id="mwaQ" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"a_0,a_1,\\dots,a_n,\\dots"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle a_{0},a_{1},\dots ,a_{n},\dots }">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <msub>
          <mi>a</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mn>0</mn>
          </mrow>
        </msub>
        <mo>,</mo>
        <msub>
          <mi>a</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mn>1</mn>
          </mrow>
        </msub>
        <mo>,</mo>
        <mo>…<!-- … --></mo>
        <mo>,</mo>
        <msub>
          <mi>a</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi>n</mi>
          </mrow>
        </msub>
        <mo>,</mo>
        <mo>…<!-- … --></mo>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle a_{0},a_{1},\dots ,a_{n},\dots }</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/9b40a4b70e0aefebf9d128901ac3a3ea7f471186" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.671ex; width:16.986ex; height:2.009ex;" alt="{\displaystyle a_{0},a_{1},\dots ,a_{n},\dots }"/></span> such that <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt50" id="mwag" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\\forall i>0, (a_{i+1},a_{i}) \\in R"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle \forall i>0,(a_{i+1},a_{i})\in R}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi mathvariant="normal">∀<!-- ∀ --></mi>
        <mi>i</mi>
        <mo>></mo>
        <mn>0</mn>
        <mo>,</mo>
        <mo stretchy="false">(</mo>
        <msub>
          <mi>a</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi>i</mi>
            <mo>+</mo>
            <mn>1</mn>
          </mrow>
        </msub>
        <mo>,</mo>
        <msub>
          <mi>a</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi>i</mi>
          </mrow>
        </msub>
        <mo stretchy="false">)</mo>
        <mo>∈<!-- ∈ --></mo>
        <mi>R</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle \forall i>0,(a_{i+1},a_{i})\in R}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/0ff713cd5022defa9b36022d0a12a4eb5dc3e321" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.838ex; width:20.997ex; height:2.843ex;" alt="{\displaystyle \forall i>0,(a_{i+1},a_{i})\in R}"/></span>), all these semantics coincide—only one extension is grounded, stable, preferred, and complete.</li></ul>

<p id="mwaw">Some other semantics have been defined.<sup about="#mwt51" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-4" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-4"}}'><a href="#cite_note-4" id="mwbA"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwbQ"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwbg">[</span>4<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwbw">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<p id="mwcA">One introduce the notation <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt52" id="mwcQ" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"Ext_\\sigma(S)"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle Ext_{\sigma }(S)}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>E</mi>
        <mi>x</mi>
        <msub>
          <mi>t</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi>σ<!-- σ --></mi>
          </mrow>
        </msub>
        <mo stretchy="false">(</mo>
        <mi>S</mi>
        <mo stretchy="false">)</mo>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle Ext_{\sigma }(S)}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/7e6c722d8f5bf205bca37004df50630202fc0689" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.838ex; width:8.426ex; height:2.843ex;" alt="{\displaystyle Ext_{\sigma }(S)}"/></span> to note the set of <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt53" id="mwcg" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\\sigma"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle \sigma }">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>σ<!-- σ --></mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle \sigma }</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/59f59b7c3e6fdb1d0365a494b81fb9a696138c36" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:1.33ex; height:1.676ex;" alt="{\displaystyle \sigma }"/></span>-extensions of the system <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt54" id="mwcw" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"S"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle S}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>S</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle S}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/4611d85173cd3b508e67077d4a1252c9c05abca2" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:1.499ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle S}"/></span>.</p>
<!--SME: what does that last sentence mean to say?-->

<p id="mwdA">In the case of the system <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt55" id="mwdQ" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"S"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle S}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>S</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle S}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/4611d85173cd3b508e67077d4a1252c9c05abca2" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:1.499ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle S}"/></span> in the figure above, <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt56" id="mwdg" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"Ext_\\sigma(S) = \\{\\{a,d\\}\\}"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle Ext_{\sigma }(S)=\{\{a,d\}\}}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>E</mi>
        <mi>x</mi>
        <msub>
          <mi>t</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi>σ<!-- σ --></mi>
          </mrow>
        </msub>
        <mo stretchy="false">(</mo>
        <mi>S</mi>
        <mo stretchy="false">)</mo>
        <mo>=</mo>
        <mo fence="false" stretchy="false">{</mo>
        <mo fence="false" stretchy="false">{</mo>
        <mi>a</mi>
        <mo>,</mo>
        <mi>d</mi>
        <mo fence="false" stretchy="false">}</mo>
        <mo fence="false" stretchy="false">}</mo>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle Ext_{\sigma }(S)=\{\{a,d\}\}}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/b32f29dc03debe85a0e367f3f3a7ec60163399e6" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.838ex; width:19.654ex; height:2.843ex;" alt="{\displaystyle Ext_{\sigma }(S)=\{\{a,d\}\}}"/></span> for every Dung's semantic—the system is well-founded. That explains why the semantics coincide, and the accepted arguments are: <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt57" id="mwdw" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"a"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle a}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>a</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle a}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/ffd2487510aa438433a2579450ab2b3d557e5edc" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:1.23ex; height:1.676ex;" alt="{\displaystyle a}"/></span> and <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt58" id="mweA" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"d"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle d}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>d</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle d}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/e85ff03cbe0c7341af6b982e47e9f90d235c66ab" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:1.216ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle d}"/></span>.</p>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="5" id="mweQ" aria-labelledby="Labellings"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading4"><h4 id="Labellings">Labellings</h4><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Argumentation_framework&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5" title="Edit section: Labellings"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mweg">Labellings are a more expressive way than extensions to express the acceptance of the arguments. Concretely, a labelling is a mapping that associates every argument with a label <i id="mwew">in</i> (the argument is accepted), <i id="mwfA">out</i> (the argument is rejected), or <i id="mwfQ">undec</i> (the argument is undefined—not accepted or refused).
One can also note a labelling as a set of pairs <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt59" id="mwfg" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"(\\mathit{argument}, \\mathit{label})"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle ({\mathit {argument}},{\mathit {label}})}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mo stretchy="false">(</mo>
        <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi class="MJX-tex-mathit" mathvariant="italic">a</mi>
            <mi class="MJX-tex-mathit" mathvariant="italic">r</mi>
            <mi class="MJX-tex-mathit" mathvariant="italic">g</mi>
            <mi class="MJX-tex-mathit" mathvariant="italic">u</mi>
            <mi class="MJX-tex-mathit" mathvariant="italic">m</mi>
            <mi class="MJX-tex-mathit" mathvariant="italic">e</mi>
            <mi class="MJX-tex-mathit" mathvariant="italic">n</mi>
            <mi class="MJX-tex-mathit" mathvariant="italic">t</mi>
          </mrow>
        </mrow>
        <mo>,</mo>
        <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi class="MJX-tex-mathit" mathvariant="italic">l</mi>
            <mi class="MJX-tex-mathit" mathvariant="italic">a</mi>
            <mi class="MJX-tex-mathit" mathvariant="italic">b</mi>
            <mi class="MJX-tex-mathit" mathvariant="italic">e</mi>
            <mi class="MJX-tex-mathit" mathvariant="italic">l</mi>
          </mrow>
        </mrow>
        <mo stretchy="false">)</mo>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle ({\mathit {argument}},{\mathit {label}})}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/8a474777ce2acd9ca7879b6b7e3adcb6db8067b7" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.838ex; width:16.898ex; height:2.843ex;" alt="{\displaystyle ({\mathit {argument}},{\mathit {label}})}"/></span>.</p>

<p id="mwfw">Such a mapping does not make sense without additional constraint. The notion of reinstatement labelling guarantees the sense of the mapping. <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt60" id="mwgA" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"L"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle L}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>L</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle L}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/103168b86f781fe6e9a4a87b8ea1cebe0ad4ede8" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:1.583ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle L}"/></span> is a reinstatement labelling on the system <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt61" id="mwgQ" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"S = \\langle A, R \\rangle"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle S=\langle A,R\rangle }">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>S</mi>
        <mo>=</mo>
        <mo fence="false" stretchy="false">⟨<!-- ⟨ --></mo>
        <mi>A</mi>
        <mo>,</mo>
        <mi>R</mi>
        <mo fence="false" stretchy="false">⟩<!-- ⟩ --></mo>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle S=\langle A,R\rangle }</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/84dbf0469d812357aabc78d46bab6afd8962a83f" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.838ex; width:10.948ex; height:2.843ex;" alt="{\displaystyle S=\langle A,R\rangle }"/></span> if and only if<span typeof="mw:DisplaySpace" id="mwgg"> </span>:</p>
<ul id="mwgw"><li id="mwhA"><span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt62" id="mwhQ" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\\forall a \\in A, L(a) = \\mathit{in}"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle \forall a\in A,L(a)={\mathit {in}}}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
