  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/9a32718816902128600a81e3477c3a62941b4644" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.838ex; width:34.635ex; height:2.843ex;" alt="{\displaystyle S_{1}\equiv _{1}S_{2}\Leftrightarrow Ext_{\sigma }(S_{1})=Ext_{\sigma }(S_{2})}"/></span><span typeof="mw:DisplaySpace" id="mw0Q"> </span>;</li>
<li id="mw0g"><span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt93" id="mw0w" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\\mathit{EQ_2}"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle {\mathit {EQ_{2}}}}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi class="MJX-tex-mathit" mathvariant="italic">E</mi>
            <msub>
              <mi class="MJX-tex-mathit" mathvariant="italic">Q</mi>
              <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
                <mn class="MJX-tex-mathit" mathvariant="italic">2</mn>
              </mrow>
            </msub>
          </mrow>
        </mrow>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle {\mathit {EQ_{2}}}}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/dc61ed402fdcb7022ade84ba2a0224606464fc88" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.671ex; width:4.431ex; height:2.509ex;" alt="{\displaystyle {\mathit {EQ_{2}}}}"/></span><span typeof="mw:DisplaySpace" id="mw1A"> </span>: two argumentation frameworks are equivalent if they accept skeptically the same arguments, that is <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt94" id="mw1Q" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"S_1 \\equiv_2 S_2 \\Leftrightarrow Sc_\\sigma(S_1) = Sc_\\sigma(S_2)"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle S_{1}\equiv _{2}S_{2}\Leftrightarrow Sc_{\sigma }(S_{1})=Sc_{\sigma }(S_{2})}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <msub>
          <mi>S</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mn>1</mn>
          </mrow>
        </msub>
        <msub>
          <mo>≡<!-- ≡ --></mo>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mn>2</mn>
          </mrow>
        </msub>
        <msub>
          <mi>S</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mn>2</mn>
          </mrow>
        </msub>
        <mo stretchy="false">⇔<!-- ⇔ --></mo>
        <mi>S</mi>
        <msub>
          <mi>c</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi>σ<!-- σ --></mi>
          </mrow>
        </msub>
        <mo stretchy="false">(</mo>
        <msub>
          <mi>S</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mn>1</mn>
          </mrow>
        </msub>
        <mo stretchy="false">)</mo>
        <mo>=</mo>
        <mi>S</mi>
        <msub>
          <mi>c</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi>σ<!-- σ --></mi>
          </mrow>
        </msub>
        <mo stretchy="false">(</mo>
        <msub>
          <mi>S</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
