    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle S_{1}\equiv _{2}S_{2}\Leftrightarrow Sc_{\sigma }(S_{1})=Sc_{\sigma }(S_{2})}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/ad9064e853b4482bc8e98c63c384bf41b2be7082" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.838ex; width:31.758ex; height:2.843ex;" alt="{\displaystyle S_{1}\equiv _{2}S_{2}\Leftrightarrow Sc_{\sigma }(S_{1})=Sc_{\sigma }(S_{2})}"/></span><span typeof="mw:DisplaySpace" id="mw1g"> </span>;</li>
<li id="mw1w"><span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt95" id="mw2A" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\\mathit{EQ_2}"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle {\mathit {EQ_{2}}}}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi class="MJX-tex-mathit" mathvariant="italic">E</mi>
            <msub>
              <mi class="MJX-tex-mathit" mathvariant="italic">Q</mi>
              <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
                <mn class="MJX-tex-mathit" mathvariant="italic">2</mn>
              </mrow>
            </msub>
          </mrow>
        </mrow>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle {\mathit {EQ_{2}}}}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/dc61ed402fdcb7022ade84ba2a0224606464fc88" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.671ex; width:4.431ex; height:2.509ex;" alt="{\displaystyle {\mathit {EQ_{2}}}}"/></span><span typeof="mw:DisplaySpace" id="mw2Q"> </span>: two argumentation frameworks are equivalent if they accept credulously the same arguments, that is <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt96" id="mw2g" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"S_1 \\equiv_3 S_2 \\Leftrightarrow Cr_\\sigma(S_1) = Cr_\\sigma(S_2)"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle S_{1}\equiv _{3}S_{2}\Leftrightarrow Cr_{\sigma }(S_{1})=Cr_{\sigma }(S_{2})}">
  <semantics>
