<li id="mwARA">Relation <i id="mwARE">rebuttal</i><span typeof="mw:DisplaySpace" id="mwARI"> </span>: <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt126" id="mwARM" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"(\\Psi,\\beta)"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle (\Psi ,\beta )}">
