</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/f2c2603683e878b63d22d50cec7b9e6b304597ed" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; margin-right: -0.13ex; width:2.983ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle {\textit {val}}}"/></span> is a mapping that associates each element from <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt134" id="mwASI" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"A"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle A}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>A</mi>
      </mstyle>
